sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Guardrails Orchestrator
    participant Server as Axum HTTP Server<br/>8080/TCP Plain TCP
    participant Handler as Detection Handler
    participant Dispatch as Detector Dispatcher
    participant Builtin as Built-in Detectors<br/>(email, SSN, credit card)
    participant Custom as Custom Regex Engine

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Detection Request Flow (Stateless, In-Memory)

    Orchestrator->>Server: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Note right of Orchestrator: Body: {"contents": ["text..."],<br/>"detector_params": {"regex": ["email", "custom_pattern"]}}

    Server->>Handler: Route matched
    Handler->>Dispatch: Resolve detector names

    loop For each regex identifier
        Dispatch->>Dispatch: Lookup in built-in HashMap
        alt Known detector (email, ssn, credit_card)
            Dispatch->>Builtin: Apply built-in regex pattern
            Builtin-->>Dispatch: Matches with positions
        else Unknown identifier
            Dispatch->>Custom: Treat as raw regex pattern
            Custom-->>Dispatch: Matches with positions
        end
    end

    Dispatch-->>Handler: Aggregated detection results
    Handler-->>Server: JSON response
    Server-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK<br/>[{start, end, text, detection_type, score}]

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Health Probe Flow

    participant Probe as Kubernetes Probe
    Probe->>Server: GET /health
    Server-->>Probe: 200 "healthy"
    Note right of Probe: No auth, no state inspection
